6.pdf","ts":"2026-08-06T14:29"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"improved","statement":"Profit after tax increased to ₹902 crores from ₹545 crores in the corresponding period of the previous year.","quote":"Profit after tax stood at ₹902 crores compared with ₹545 crores in the same period of previous year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The company experienced a net foreign exchange loss of ₹7 crores this quarter, compared to a net gain of ₹39 crores in the same quarter last year.","quote":"During the quarter, the forex movements resulted in a net forex loss of ₹7 crores compared with a net gain of ₹39 crores in the corresponding quarter of the previous financial year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Solvent costs remained high during a major portion of the quarter, even though some raw material prices decreased.","quote":"While prices of certain raw materials moderated during the quarter, solvent costs remain elevated for a significant part of the period.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company expects to achieve double-digit revenue growth.","quote":"We would say, if you want to look at a revenue projection, we are looking at double-digit growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company plans to begin commercialization for the second customer in the coming months, which will involve significant volumes.","quote":"The second one, we will start in the next few months. And this will be substantial quantities going forward.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":16.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Management projects that the company will achieve double-digit revenue growth.","quote":"We would say, if you want to look at a revenue projection, we are looking at double-digit growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company expects the full-year EBITDA margin to be similar to the previous year's level.","quote":"At gross level, I would say it was approximately 60% all over the year. And frankly speaking, if I'm looking at EBITDA margin, it would be the similar as last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The company is increasing its capabilities and capacities to satisfy the demand of the changing global market.","quote":"As we look ahead, we are actively expanding in both capabilities and capacities to meet the demand of a rapidly evolving global market.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Generic business volumes were stable, but pricing continues to show competitive market conditions across different products and regions.","quote":"Beginning with our Generic business, volumes remained stable during the quarter, while pricing continues to reflect competitive market conditions across products and geographies.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"The company has slightly raised prices for customers where feasible to maintain product viability.","quote":"Even we have increased our price slightly wherever possible with our customers because otherwise the products become unviable to even produce.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Solvent costs remained high during most of the quarter, despite some moderation in other raw material prices.","quote":"While prices of certain raw materials moderated during the quarter, solvent costs remain elevated for a significant part of the period.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"High freight rates for ocean and air transport, along with tight container availability, required careful planning.","quote":"Freight rates across both ocean and air transportation remained elevated while the availability of containers and ISO tanks continued to require careful planning and coordination.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Margins were slightly higher than the prior quarter due to a higher contribution of 60% from the custom synthesis business.","quote":"Considering this quarter, we did have more of custom synthesis, which is 60%. We do see the margins slightly higher than the previous quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The company expects the full-year EBITDA margin to align with last year's performance.","quote":"At gross level, I would say it was approximately 60% all over the year. And frankly speaking, if I'm looking at EBITDA margin, it would be the similar as last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"Capital work in progress reached ₹2,034 crores at the end of June 2026, showing ongoing progress on expansion projects.","quote":"capital work in progress stood at ₹2,034 crores as of June 30, 2026, reflecting the continuous progress of our ongoing expansion projects.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The three major projects previously declared to the stock market total approximately ₹2,000 crores.","quote":"So that's about, I would say, one that we declared to the stock market earlier was the 3 projects together about, if I remember correctly, ₹2,000 crores.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Capacity utilization across all three manufacturing units is approximately 80% to 85%.","quote":"I cannot comment unit by unit because each unit is quite different. But I would say across all the 3 units, it is about 80% to 85% utilization.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":14.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The company is expanding its capacity by purchasing additional 3,000-liter solid-phase peptide synthesis equipment.","quote":"That's why we're even -- in my speech, I mentioned, we're again expanding our capacity by acquiring a few more 3,000-liter SPPS.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"The company is currently working on signing long-term contracts with two customers for iodine-based contrast media.","quote":"So on the Iodine-based contrast media, we are in the process of signing long-term contracts with 2 of the customers.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"At the end of the quarter, the company held cash and cash equivalents of ₹3,611 crores.","quote":"As of the end of the quarter, cash and cash equivalents stood at ₹3,611 crores, trade receivables were ₹3,056 crores and inventory stood at ₹4,413 crores.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Multiple customers are currently qualifying the company for products like Brivaracetam and Ticagrelor.","quote":"And other than that, products like I could mention 1 or 2 like we Brivaracetam, Ticagrelor which we have filed, multiple customers are qualifying us as we speak.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company is negotiating a long-term exclusivity agreement with one of its customers.","quote":"One of them actually is trying to look at having exclusivity with us long term. So right now, that negotiation is going on.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Current market pricing changes represent a correction driven by significant increases in raw material costs.","quote":"So whatever you're seeing right now is a market correction based on the raw material prices that have taken a substantial hit.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"The changing geopolitical situation in West Asia has created more uncertainty for global supply chains.","quote":"At the same time, the evolving geopolitical situation in West Asia has introduced additional uncertainty into global supply chain.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"I would like to stick to my statement saying that we will show double-digit growth no matter what.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIVISLAB_06082026142802_Transcript_Concall_01082026.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[]}}],"fdb":{"eq":[{"qe":"2012-06-30","basis":"standalone","rev":468.4,"pbt":214.3,"pat":167.4,"eps":12.61,"pub":"2012-08-06"},{"qe":"2012-09-30","basis":"standalone","rev":472.6,"pbt":154.4,"pat":118.0,"eps":8.89,"pub":"2012-11-03"},{"qe":"2012-12-31","basis":"standalone","rev":533.3,"pbt":183.8,"pat":144.2,"eps":10.86,"pub":"2013-02-04"},{"qe":"2013-03-31","basis":"consolidated","rev":655.8,"pbt":236.9,"pat":180.6,"eps":13.6,"pub":"2013-05-21"},{"qe":"2013-06-30","basis":"standalone","rev":515.9,"rev_y":10.1,"pbt":229.3,"pat":174.7,"pat_y":4.4,"eps":13.16,"pub":"2013-08-05"},{"qe":"2013-09-30","basis":"standalone","rev":565.9,"rev_y":19.7,"pbt":262.4,"pat":204.9,"pat_y":73.7,"eps":15.44,"pub":"2013-11-26"},{"qe":"2013-12-31","basis":"standalone","rev":687.4,"rev_y":28.9,"pbt":27